<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c. bank 13-week bills avg yield 13.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Czech c. bank 13-week bills avg yield 13.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yield in a Dutch auction offering eight billion crowns in Czech National Bank 13-week liquidity bills was 13.5 percent, and the auction was undersubscribed with bids totaling 4.943 billion crowns, the CNB said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
